<BaseLayout title="About OmniAI Studio" description="Learn what OmniAI Studio is, what it builds, and how the studio approaches practical AI automation and intelligent systems." canonical="https://omniaistudio.in/about">
<div class="page"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT OMNIAI STUDIO</p><h1 class="display">A small AI studio focused on making useful systems.</h1><p class="lead">OmniAI Studio is an AI automation and intelligent systems studio building practical workflows, document-processing systems, AI agents, integrations, and custom business tools.</p><section class="section two"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><h2>Automation should remove friction, not create another layer of complexity.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>The studio approaches AI as part of an engineered system. A strong solution may combine deterministic code, workflow orchestration, APIs, databases, AI models, validation, monitoring, and human review.</p><p>Projects published here are labeled honestly. Demonstrations and prototypes are not presented as client results, and verified outcomes can be added when real deployments produce evidence.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CORE SPECIALTIES</p><h2>What OmniAI Studio is building around.</h2></div></div><div class="kicker-grid"><div><strong>AI automation</strong><span>Business process automation and workflow orchestration.</span></div><div><strong>Document intelligence</strong><span>Extraction, classification, validation, and routing.</span></div><div><strong>AI agents</strong><span>Task-focused systems with tools and guardrails.</span></div><div><strong>Custom systems</strong><span>Internal tools and integrations for specific operations.</span></div></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
